            "review_title": "Review at Alibaba Kitchen & Bar",
            "review_text": "Sunshine09948248205\n5 contributions\n0\nbusiness dinne\nAug 2024 • Business\nI chose Alibaba Kitchen & Bar for our business dinner and it was a great choice. The place has a nice, relaxed atmosphere that was perfect for catching up. I was particularly impressed by the Persian-inspired architecture. The food was diverse and we both enjoyed our meals. It's a great spot if you're looking for something unique.\nInsider tip:\nI love this place at night, cause the lights create such a warm and cozy vibe.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 20, 2024",
